  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9f2e8e5b57bd4bd99f33dd56077c2d1, type: 3}
  m_Name: KB_036_WrongDns
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: POSTechSupport::POSTechSupport.Data.KnowledgeArticleSO
  articleId: KB-036
  title: Internet works but the till can't find our records
  category: 4
  content: "'Can't find the database' has two causes that produce the identical message:
    the host name is wrong (KB-012), or the name is right and nothing here can resolve
    it. Read the name character by character first \u2014 if it is correct, the resolver
    is the problem.\nA public DNS server resolves public sites happily and knows
    nothing about the shop's internal names, which is exactly why the customer can
    browse the news while the till cannot see its own database."
  relatedErrorCodes: []
  guidanceForIssueIds:
  - P36
